WEBVTT

00:04:00.036 --> 00:04:01.436
And the third thing,

00:04:01.436 --> 00:04:03.676
which very few people talk about,

00:04:03.716 --> 00:04:04.836
is density.

00:04:05.196 --> 00:04:07.596
So as I mentioned earlier,

00:04:07.636 --> 00:04:10.876
the large city, we must have
a higher density,

00:04:10.916 --> 00:04:13.436
and make the design more grand.

00:04:13.436 --> 00:04:15.636
Small city, we have low density,

00:04:15.636 --> 00:04:17.636
make the design more romantic.

00:04:17.676 --> 00:04:24.556
So if we pick the right density
for the cities of different sizes,

00:04:24.596 --> 00:04:26.316
when you arrive at a city,

00:04:26.316 --> 00:04:28.436
without even looking at the buildings,

00:04:28.436 --> 00:04:31.836
you already know you're going
into a different kind of city.